sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App / BLE Thread
    participant Radio as BLE Radio
    participant rs as rs_ble_broadcast
    participant Scanner as Phone Scanner / Sniffer

    App->>Radio: Open g_ble_abs0
    Note over App,Radio: Radio boots and loads GTL firmware
    Radio-->>App: GAPM_DEVICE_READY_IND
    App->>Radio: R_BLE_GAP_Init()

    loop Until GAP-ready
        App->>Radio: R_BLE_Execute()
        Radio-->>App: BLE stack events
    end

    App->>App: Build or select app beacon payload
    App->>rs: rs_ble_broadcast_Start(bytes, length, params)
    rs->>Radio: R_BLE_GAP_SetAdvParam()
    rs->>Radio: R_BLE_VS_SetTxPower()
    rs->>Radio: R_BLE_GAP_SetAdvSresData()
    rs->>Radio: R_BLE_GAP_StartAdv()

    Radio-->>Scanner: Non-connectable advertising frame
